      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S PRIMED (6) flew the lids with a fast early split last time, hitting the frame with a 1.1 lengths third (25.59) over 450m at Warrnambool and making it two placings on end. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. One of the leading chances. HURRICANE (1) is a talented dog who is a winner of nine races and filled a minor placing latest when second at Geelong (25.79). Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from five starts. Expected to feature again. REGAL SPENCER (3) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (30.56) at The Meadows behind Paw Quebec in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature again. PAW VARNA (2) was in the money last time at The Meadows (30.43) in a Grade 5, finishing a 4 length second. Has already won two times from this draw.",
